I am still lying in bed and take my phone.
Usually I take the U-Bahn to the office now.
But today I am not working.
I call my colleague Jonas.
He answers the phone immediately.
"Good morning, Maya," he says.
"Morning, Jonas," I answer quietly.
"I am not coming to the office today, because I am sick."
Jonas immediately sounds worried.
"Oh no, you do not sound good at all," he says.
"Yes, I really do not feel well," I say.
"My head hurts a lot."
"That sounds like a heavy cold," Jonas says.
He is very sympathetic.
"You should stay in bed and rest," he advises me.
"Yes, I am definitely staying in the flat today," I say.
"Good."
"I will let the team in the office know," he says.
"Thank you, Jonas," I answer.
"Get well soon, Maya!" he wishes me.
I put the phone away and close my eyes again.
